  "body": "Independent CHECK MAINLINE-022d complete; owner code was not read or run. All 64 primary witnesses and 1,792 numeric table cells reproduce. Independent starts recover all 176 primary/sensitivity optima within 1e-6 SF; no materially better witness found.\n\nBest equilateral in-band: SF 1.258252476558 at s=3.170758569107 m; arc length/half-wave 3.184193539 m. Both Zylon plies total 214.541557545 kg. Candidate-sized joints weigh 44.191468267 kg and have axial/bond multipliers equal to target. Target extreme compression is 1.198096384 GPa; opposite-face tension is zero.\n\nExact mismatch ledger: 50 field differences in 16 square-membrane sensitivity rows, from declared coefficient 0.07028850747757764 versus output-implied 0.07028850698306077. Maximum least-SF effect 3.98e-9; primary result unaffected. NFI requests consistent coefficient/truncation documentation.\n\nRequired continuum NFI: frozen 026b frequency-4 discrete linear 5.254643802 versus continuum 6.193381346, 15.1571% lower despite the member-wave screen. This is not a universal correction to 022d.\n\nNine NFIs also carry material/contact reliability, complete membrane, joint density/bond/stiffness, local-shell conventions, two-way shear, manufacture/mass and search extent. Qualified SF, compression allowable and failure probability remain null. Five one-core simjob invocations completed and released; no time budget. CHECK names no successor.",
